OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA wet start for most, although
OL,6,Frain pushes away to the northeast
OL,7,Fallowing drier and somewhat brighter
OL,8,Fspells to develop during the morning.
OL,9,FWinds strengthen as the rain clears,
OL,10,Fwith gales likely later near coasts
OL,11,Fand over hills.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA dry but cloudy evening for
OL,14,Fmany. A band of heavy rain pushes in
OL,15,Ffrom the west overnight clearing most
OL,16,Fof the region by dawn. Gale force
OL,17,Fwinds likely.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
