OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA bright and breezy day with
OL,6,Fisolated showers and plenty of sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Feeling fresh in the strong
OL,8,Fbreeze, this easing through the
OL,9,Fafternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:FA
OL,12,Fshowery start to Wednesday before
OL,13,Fturning drier and brighter by
OL,14,Fafternoon. Sunny spells and light
OL,15,Fwinds Thursday, before cloud starts to
OL,16,Fbuild again Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
